{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.CrystalGraphRealization"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.canonical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.canonical","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CemeteryGroupEmergence.lean#L74-L103","doc":"**The trivial model — a `def`, not an `instance`, and not \"faithful\".**\n\nIts docstring said *\"Faithful instance. Carries the explicit research-grade\nconjecture as a sorry.\"* Neither half was true. There is no `sorry`: it sets\n`tauImage _ := 0`, so `monotone_under_extension` is discharged by `rfl` on\n`0 = 0` and the `inCemetery` hypothesis is never used. The observation\nfunctor annihilates cemetery nodes here because it annihilates everything.\nA `sorry` would at least be visible to `#print axioms`; this was not.\n\n`inCemetery v := ∃ T, nodeOf T = v` is the one non-degenerate field, and it\nis the field the conjecture does not turn on: monotonicity is vacuous\nagainst a `τ` that is identically zero.\n\nAs an unconditional `instance` it made `tauImage_eq_zero_of_inCemetery` and\n`killSwitch_zero_mul` — the kill-switch property the GS reduction engine is\nsupposed to prune with — unconditional theorems about the zero map.\n\nDemoted the same way as `ConfinementGradingCorrespondence.canonical`\n(bean `qou-fngs`). Nothing consumed it: the class has no users outside this\nfile.\n\n**Still open:** `conj:cemetery-group-emergence` — that `Z_n = ker τ` is\nmonotone under crystal extension for a `τ` that is not identically zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.killSwitch_zero_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.killSwitch_zero_mul","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CemeteryGroupEmergence.lean#L59-L72","doc":"**Conditional theorem (kill-switch property).**\n\nConditional on `[CemeteryGroupEmergence R q]`: if the crystal\nnode of `T` is in the cemetery, then the observation-functor\nimage vanishes, *and* the value `R`-multiplied by anything stays\nzero — formalising the \"kill switch\" pruning property used by\nthe GS reduction engine. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.tauImage_eq_zero_of_inCemetery","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.tauImage_eq_zero_of_inCemetery","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CemeteryGroupEmergence.lean#L49-L57","doc":"Unconditional structural corollary: any normal form whose crystal\nnode is in the cemetery has `τ`-image zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.monotone_under_extension","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.monotone_under_extension","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CemeteryGroupEmergence.lean#L44-L44","doc":"**The conjecture (monotonicity)**: if `nodeOf T` lies in `Z_n`,\nthen `τ T = 0`.  Plays the role of `sorry`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.tauImage","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.tauImage","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CemeteryGroupEmergence.lean#L41-L41","doc":"Image under the observation functor `τ` (graded character) of\na normal form.  Lives in `R` for definiteness; abstract\ninstances may refine this. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.inCemetery","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.inCemetery","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CemeteryGroupEmergence.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Predicate: a crystal node lies in the cemetery group `Z_n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence.mk","kind":"ctor","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CemeteryGroupEmergence.lean#L34-L34","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CemeteryGroupEmergence","kind":"class","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CemeteryGroupEmergence.lean#L27-L45","doc":"**Cemetery-group emergence (conjecture).**\n\nEncodes monotonicity of the cemetery filter under crystal\nextensions: if a prefix lies in `Z_n`, every continuation also\nlies in `Z_n`, and `τ` annihilates the extended normal form. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:cemetery-group-emergence","label":"conj:cemetery-group-emergence","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/cemetery-group-emergence.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}